# Java basics

A short map of three ideas. Each branch is written as an ordinary bullet list.

@animate
# Java basics
- Integer division
  - 7 / 2 gives 3
  - Assigning to double gives 3.0
- Type promotion
  - 7 / 2.0 gives 3.5
  - A double operand changes the division
- Casting
  - Cast before division
  - (double) 7 / 2 gives 3.5
@end

Integer division happens before an assignment conversion. A later cast cannot recover the fractional part. Keep longer explanations here in the document, rather than adding them to the map.
